---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Us" description="Learn about Climate Action Coffee (CAC) and The Pollinators subgroup - promoting native plants and pollinators in the DC area since 2019.">

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-700 to-emerald-600 text-white -mt-8 pt-8 pb-12 sm:pb-16 rounded-b-3xl mx-2 sm:mx-auto max-w-6xl">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-center mb-8">About Us</h1>
    <img
      src="/images/about-banner.jpg"
      alt="Nature painting by Marguerite Cyr"
      class="rounded-xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-lg mx-auto"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <p class="text-center text-emerald-200 mt-4 italic">Painting by Marguerite Cyr</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Climate Action Coffee -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="section-title flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-3xl">☕</span> Climate Action Coffee (CAC)
    </h2>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <p class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">Weekly Zoom: Wednesday mornings 8:00 to 9:30 AM</p>
      <a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88246766222?pwd=TzRPNkt0a09sbzRoMFpTdTZITU9ZZz09" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary text-sm">
        Join the Zoom
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 space-y-4">
      <p>
        The origins of this website go back to the <strong>Takoma Park Mobilization</strong> and one of its subgroups &mdash; the <strong>Takoma Alliance for Local Living Economy (TALLE)</strong>. One of TALLE's members had a conversation with Andy Shallal, the founder &amp; owner of Busboys and Poets, in which he offered us weekly use of the big meeting space at the Takoma BB&amp;P store along with free coffee and tea. Thus was born what came to be known as <em>"Climate Action Coffee"</em> (CAC) in October of 2019, meeting from 7 &ndash; 8:30 am. When the pandemic hit CAC pivoted to weekly meetings via Zoom at 8 &ndash; 9:30 am.
      </p>

      <p>There are now three subgroups:</p>

      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li class="card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800">Takoma Stormwater Solutions</h3>
          <a href="https://www.takomastormwatersolutions.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link">takomastormwatersolutions.net</a>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800">Takoma Park Community Food Forest Collective</h3>
          <a href="https://www.foodforestcollective.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link">foodforestcollective.org</a>
        </li>
        <li class="card border-l-4 border-green-500 bg-green-50">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800">The Pollinators &nbsp;<span class="text-sm font-normal text-green-600">(this website)</span></h3>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The Pollinators -->
<section class="section bg-stone-50">
  <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="section-title flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-3xl">🐝</span> The Pollinators
    </h2>

    <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 space-y-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <p>
        Our focus is on <strong>action</strong>, and educating people about the value of our natural environment. In particular, <em>native plants and pollinators</em> are promoted as integral parts of a healthy landscape, both public and private.
      </p>

      <p>We often have a table at local events such as:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-gray-700">
        <li>Takoma Park Folk Festival</li>
        <li>Earth Day celebrations</li>
        <li>National Pollinator Week (around June 20)</li>
      </ul>

      <p>We also sponsor a <strong>plant swap every spring and fall</strong> (see the <a href="/events/" class="resource-link">Current Events</a> page).</p>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800 mb-2">Meetings</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Every other Thursday morning by Zoom from <strong>9:00 to 10:30 AM</strong></p>
        <a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88246766222?pwd=TzRPNkt0a09sbzRoMFpTdTZITU9ZZz09" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary text-sm mt-3 inline-block">
          Join the Zoom
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Event photos -->
    <h3 class="subsection-title text-center mt-12">Pollinator Week 2024</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <figure class="text-center">
        <img
          src="/images/barbara-whitney-pollinator-week-2024.jpg"
          alt="Barbara Whitney reading at People's Book on Pollinator Week 2024"
          class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Barbara Whitney reading at People's Book on Pollinator Week 2024</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="text-center">
        <img
          src="/images/sam-droge-pollinator-week-2024.jpg"
          alt="Sam Droge speaking about insects for Pollinator Week 2024"
          class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Sam Droge speaking about insects for Pollinator Week 2024</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Contact -->
<section class="section bg-green-50">
  <div class="container-narrow text-center max-w-xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 text-lg">Want to get involved?</p>
    <a href="mailto:kallen808@gmail.com" class="btn-primary">
      Email Ken to Join Us
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

</PageLayout>
